A glossy gray icon in the [[frutiger-aero|Frutiger Aero]] style, with a soft gradient fill and a thick rounded outline. OpenDB uses it on the `{{images needed}}` template, for entries that would be clearer with a picture. A smaller copy is used on the site itself.
